def unit(path,a,b,io):
 raw=(R/path).read_bytes();assert raw==subprocess.check_output(['git','show',RC+':'+path],cwd=R)
 assert b<=len(raw.splitlines())
 return {'identity':{'repo':str(R),'commit':RC,'tree':'7589c800b61ba13a13040ed0d686979b80a84fd0','path':path,'bytes':len(raw),'lines':len(raw.splitlines()),'sha256':hashlib.sha256(raw).hexdigest(),'git_blob':subprocess.check_output(['git','rev-parse',RC+':'+path],cwd=R,text=True).strip()},'range':[a,b],'text':'\n'.join((R/path).read_text().splitlines()[a-1:b])+'\n','actual_reader':reader,'actual_read_io':io,'qualification':'Complete contained source unit; no whole enclosing-file credit except the independently complete595-line Success source.'}
def freeze(n,v):
 t=P/n;assert not t.exists();raw=(json.dumps(v,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n').encode();t.write_bytes(raw);return {'path':n,'bytes':len(raw),'sha256':hashlib.sha256(raw).hexdigest()}
pre=['Fixed R/B8, no extra registrations/redefinition/concurrent mutation, valid battle/scene/registry inputs and normal earlier calls unless a failure prefix is expressly stated.','The optional Shadow files require explicit effective activation; their nested existence supplies no default activation.','Only the18primaryMove metadata and their shared named success interfaces are bound. Referenced ability/item groups are limited to the actual complete bodies below; callback/native outcomes outside these propositions remain their original-domain contracts or OPEN.','All deductions are SOURCE_STATIC; no Ruby/game/native/PP/accuracy/random experiment or business model is executed.']
meanings=[
 ('SSI01','CanChoose10–100 rechecks Disable(except specialUsage), HealBlock/healing, Gravity/flag, ThroatChop/sound, rememberedChoiceBand/GorillaTactics, Taunt(status/non-special), Torment/non-Instructed/non-special, opposingImprison and command-onlyAssaultVest. It clears an invalid remembered ChoiceBand move before later checks. Move-specific pbCanChooseMove is last; this method alone is not the entire outer PP/menu contract.'),
 ('SSI02','Obedience107–127 bypasses multi-turn, nonUseMove, externalbattle and non-player-owned cases; ordinary configured high-level refusal and actual Hyper obedience combine before pbDisobey. Full Disobey129–176 may mutateRage and choice/index/move/target, sleep or confusionHP, or returnfalse. No unconditional originalmove execution follows a failed order.'),
 ('SSI03','TryUse183–297 first calls CanChoose, then rejects SkyDrop/recharge/Palace-2; skipAccuracyCheck returns before sleep/freeze/obedience/Truant/flinch/confusion/paralysis/attract checks. Normal paths preserve each stated order and mutation: sleepCount/confusionCount, curedstatus, Truant toggle and lastMoveFailed can precede later rejection. A prior mutation is not rolled back.'),
 ('SSI04','AgainstTarget303–526 writes computed typeMod before the charging-turn earlyreturn and before move-specific failure. It then checks PsychicTerrain using savedpositivepriority, CraftyShield, the remaining protection family, reflection, abilityimmunity, damaging typeimmunity, PranksterDark, Groundairborne, powder and statusSubstitute. This source order is not interchangeable with checking only Accuracy100.'),
 ('SSI05','All18originalShadow records have CanProtect. The flag is read case-insensitively by the ordinary Move getter. Except the actual UnseenFist+contact bypass, WideGuard checks multiple-targetcount outside the CanProtect block; QuickGuard checks savedpositivepriority; Protect, damagingKingsShield, SpikyShield, BanefulBunker, damagingObstruct and damagingMatBlock retain their separate conditions and reached writes. No side protection is inferred solely from English move descriptions.'),
 ('SSI06','MagicCoat/Bounce applies only status+canMagicCoat, non-semi-invulnerable opposing target. The source records damageState reflection, consumes MagicCoat or sets the MagicBounce flag before returningfalse; the later outer reflection action is the separately read UseMove consumer, not this return itself.'),
 ('SSI07','Move pbImmunityByAbility88–96 returnsfalse for moldBreaker, otherwise invokes the active target ability group. All12registered IDs in the complete defaultMoveImmunity group were read (11add bodies plus DRYSKIN copy). Bulletproof tests Bomb; Soundproof tests Sound and generation/self; Telepathy rejects damaging ally attacks; WonderGuard rejects damaging non-super-effective actual calculatedtype. Type-specific statraise/heal helpers first reject self and nonmatching type.'),
 ('SSI08','The actual Shadow flags include Sound only on SHADOWPANIC, so active non-bypassed Soundproof can reject that status move through the shared immunity receiver. No primary record has Bomb. With unchanged calculatedSHADOW type, the four elemental absorber types do not match; Telepathy still applies to qualifying damaging ally targets and WonderGuard depends on the actual Shadow typeMod/nonShadow-vs-Shadow individual predicate. Type-changing consumers retain their own actual contracts, not a frozen alwaysSHADOW promise.'),
 ('SSI09','PerHit532–581 accepts charging, matchingLockOn or moveoverride first. Otherwise NoGuard/futureSight/HelpingHand can bypass semi-invulnerability; sky/underground/underwater/removal and SkyDrop each use their own gate. Only after no invulnerabilitymiss does skipAccuracyCheck bypass actualaccuracy. Accuracy100 is not an unconditional hit promise. Miss586–594 selects actual affiliation/multi/two-turn/move-specific feedback.'),
 ('SSI10','Complete StatusCheck/StatusImmunity/NonIgnorable/FromAlly registrations414–509 preserve ComatoseKomala, FlowerVeilGrass, explicit status-specific Immunity/Insomnia/Limber/MagmaArmor/WaterVeil and aliases, LeafGuardSunpair, ShieldsDownMinior<form7 and ally group predicates. The previously whole-read575-line status helper determines active/mold/substitute/terrain/order eligibility. Confusion uses directOwnTempo and generationMisty/Safeguard gates, not the major-status enum callback.'),
 ('SSI11','Complete stat-loss immunity groups670–792 preserve BigPecksDEFENSE, ClearBody/WhiteSmokeallstats, FlowerVeilGrass, HyperCutterATTACK, KeenEyeACCURACY, nonignorableFullMetalBody and allyFlowerVeilGrass. Thus actual ShadowDownDEFENSE and ShadowMistEVASION are not universally guaranteed-2. Competitive/Defiant804–816 react to an opposing or absent source by raising SpAttack/Attack2 via their real helper; the original stat write can already be committed.'),
 ('SSI12','The AbilityHandlerHash registry and defaultfalse trigger/wrappers are preserved separately from callback bodies; missing/nil return becomesfalse for these immunity APIs. Message/animation or nested ability failures can interrupt before return, retaining reached metadata/flag/HP/stage writes. Native output, complete allAbility callbacks and all740Move bodies are not inferred from this finite interface.')]
